flowchart TD
    A["File sitting in<br/>VAULT_DIR/incoming"] --> B["Local LLM (Ollama)<br/>reads the content"]

    B --> C["Infer tags +<br/>YAML metadata"]
    B --> D["Infer topic / subtopic"]

    C --> E{"User already<br/>added tags?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["Keep user tags,<br/>LLM adds taxonomy tags"]
    E -->|No| G["LLM assigns tags<br/>from scratch"]

    D --> H["Topic/subtopic maps to<br/>target vault subfolder"]
    F --> I
    G --> I
    H --> I["Note filed into<br/>target vault path"]

    I --> J{"Note references images,<br/>documents, or other files?"}
    J -->|Yes| K["Referenced files placed in a<br/>sibling attachment directory<br/>next to the note"]
    J -->|No| L
    K --> L["Smart Connections indexes<br/>the note (.smart-env)"]

    L --> M["Note is searchable +<br/>semantically retrievable"]
